{"files": [{"id": 34816449, "name": "ppat.1010464.s003.tif", "size": 2080606, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/34816449", "supplied_md5": "2e59e52b24a263574ced7f2b03d98cfa", "computed_md5": "2e59e52b24a263574ced7f2b03d98cfa", "mimetype": "image/tiff"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 12419190, "full_name": "Oded Danziger", "first_name": "Oded", "last_name": "Danziger", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 9733813, "full_name": "Roosheel S. Patel", "first_name": "Roosheel S.", "last_name": "Patel", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 12419193, "full_name": "Emma J. DeGrace", "first_name": "Emma J.", "last_name": "DeGrace", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 12419196, "full_name": "Mikaela R. Rosen", "first_name": "Mikaela R.", "last_name": "Rosen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 5754194, "full_name": "Brad R. Rosenberg", "first_name": "Brad R.", "last_name": "Rosenberg", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/Complete_validation_results_of_screen_hits_tested_in_targeted_CRISPRa_studies_/19600935", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p><b>(A)</b> qRT-PCR analysis demonstrates effective CRISPRa gene induction in A549-SunTag ACE2 cells. Values indicate fold change expression (Dox<sup>on</sup> relative to Dox<sup>off</sup>) for indicated genes (<i>CD74</i>, <i>OAS1</i> and <i>CTSS</i>) in A549-SunTag ACE2 cells expressing either corresponding gRNA or NTG. Fold change values calculated using the \u0394\u0394Ct method with GAPDH as normalization control. Undetectable Ct value for Dox<sup>off</sup> condition of cells expressing NTG and probed for <i>CD74</i> expression was set to 40 to enable fold change calculation. <b>(B)</b> qRT-PCR mean threshold cycle (Ct) values for <i>CD74</i>, <i>OAS1</i>, <i>CTSS</i> and <i>GAPDH</i> in A549-SunTag ACE2 cells expressing gRNA against gene of interest (GOI, circle) or NTG (diamond) in Dox<sup>on</sup> and Dox<sup>off</sup> cells. Error bars indicate \u00b1 SD Ct value. <b>(C)</b> Representative flow cytometry histograms for SARS-CoV-2 N protein in A549-SunTag ACE2 and A549<sup>\u0394STAT1</sup>-SunTag ACE2 transduced with indicated gRNAs, treated (red) or not treated (gray) with Dox, at 24 hours post-infection with SARS-CoV-2 (M.O.I. = 2). <b>(D)</b> Percent of infected (SARS-CoV-2 N protein positive) cells quantified across biological replicates (n = 3) for experiments described in (C). Values denote percent of infected cells in Dox<sup>on</sup> cultures relative to paired Dox<sup>off</sup> cultures. Points represent individual biological replicates, black lines indicate mean values of biological replicates for each indicated ISG gRNA. Red points indicate statistical significance (p < 0.05) as determined by paired ratio Student\u2019s t-test. <b>(E)</b> Representative immunofluorescence images for SARS-CoV-2 N protein and DAPI in A549-SunTag ACE2 and A549<sup>\u0394STAT1</sup>-SunTag ACE2 transduced with indicated gRNAs and treated with Dox, at 72 hours post-infection with SARS-CoV-2 (M.O.I. = 2). <b>(F)</b> Percent of infected (SARS-CoV-2 N protein positive) cells quantified across biological replicates for experiments described in (E). Values denote percent of infected cells in Dox<sup>on</sup> cultures relative to paired Dox<sup>off</sup> cultures. Points represent individual biological replicates, black lines indicate mean values of biological replicates for each indicated ISG gRNA. Statistical significance as in (D).</p> <p>(TIF)</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 2080606, "created_date": "2022-04-14T17:53:57Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-14T07:24:31Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["pooled genetic screens", "isogenic cell lines", "cdna expression experiments", "proapoptotic isg activities", "inducible isg expression", "isg antiviral functions", "isg repertoire", "antiviral state", "viral specificities", "throughput interrogation", "throughput approach", "studies demonstrate", "stimulated genes"], "keywords": ["pooled genetic screens", "isogenic cell lines", "cdna expression experiments", "proapoptotic isg activities", "inducible isg expression", "isg antiviral functions", "isg repertoire", "antiviral state", "viral specificities", "throughput interrogation", "throughput approach", "studies demonstrate", "stimulated genes"], "categories": [{"id": 13, "title": "Genetics", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 14, "title": "Molecular Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 24, "title": "Evolutionary Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 272, "title": "Environmental Sciences not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 33, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 46, "title": "Immunology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 734, "title": "Biological Sciences not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 61, "title": "Developmental Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 64, "title": "Cancer", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 134, "title": "Virology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}], "references": ["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.ppat.1010464"], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Danziger, Oded; Patel, Roosheel S.; DeGrace, Emma J.; Rosen, Mikaela R.; Rosenberg, Brad R. (2022). Complete validation resu